{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a legend in an idle RPG where the fight never ends and the loot is infinite. Slay thousands of monsters, collect legendary gear, and grow infinitely powerful with gem crafting and prestige systems. Your hero fights for you 24/7, so your progress never stops.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/5b39c69fc6864d648fc947e9ab068167.poster.avif?t=1761735872\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/5b39c69fc6864d648fc947e9ab068167.webm?t=1761735872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/5b39c69fc6864d648fc947e9ab068167.mp4?t=1761735872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game of strategy, not just clicks. Every piece of gear matters, with procedurally generated stats and powerful legendary effects.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/adb2a6ba980be6b43f36a61b21adb2e5.poster.avif?t=1761735872\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/adb2a6ba980be6b43f36a61b21adb2e5.webm?t=1761735872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/adb2a6ba980be6b43f36a61b21adb2e5.mp4?t=1761735872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble for greatness by crafting mighty gems, but be warned\u2014failure could shatter them to dust. Customize your hero's stats, create specialized equipment loadouts, and gather an army of companions to conquer the 